        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="-307.339089473684" YPOS="1513.848" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="219040608" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="320.339889473684" HEIGHT="181.741300397187" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L320.34 0 L320.34 181.741 L0 181.741 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L320.34 0 L320.34 181.741 L0 181.741 L0 0 Z" gXpos="-307.339089473684" gYpos="1513.84799999999" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" PSTYLE="Default Paragraph Style" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" LANGUAGE="en_US"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Alex Soda"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" CH="Conflict of interest free!"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Rabbits have officially claimed squatters’ rights on the CMU Mall and CFA Lawn following years of occupation. The invasive creatures were first introduced fifty years ago when a freshman living in Mudge brought their hobby rabbit farm to campus. The university initially tried to contain them, but efforts ceased after a particularly short member of Furries@CMU was mistakenly shot."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Meanwhile, the rabbits continue to stake their claim on the land. They said (through a monkey that knows sign language), “PA Code § 5530 is clear that the rabbits have the right to live on CMU campus for eternity.&quot; CMU strongly disagrees: “We are closely consulting with our university lawyer to get these vermin off our holy land,” said a CMU spokesperson. “He’s very busy though, so it might be a bit.” "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Using their newfound rights, the rabbits have already enlisted the help of the deer (also seeking squatters’ rights) to replant the Mall trees and construct a large model of a killer rabbit in front of the CFA. “You’re never putting up another tent on the CFA Lawn,” the rabbits taunted. CMU is currently working on a proposal to move the killer robot somewhere which satisfies all members of the community."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
